    fibo-be-ge-ge:hasFullSovereigntyOver lcc-3166-1:Guatemala ;
    fibo-be-ge-ge:isRepresentedBy fibo-be-ge-ctlaj:GovernmentOfTheRepublicOfGuatemala .

fibo-be-ge-ctlaj:HonduranEntity a owl:NamedIndividual,
