        "The https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/20220801/GovernmentEntities/AsianJurisdiction/EasternAsiaGovernmentEntitiesAndJurisdictions.rdf version of the ontology was modified to use the Commons Ontology Library (Commons) Annotation Vocabulary rather than the OMG's Specification Metadata vocabulary.",
        "The https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/20230101/GovernmentEntities/AsianJurisdiction/EasternAsiaGovernmentEntitiesAndJurisdictions.rdf version of the ontology was modified to replace additional content that is now available in the OMG Commons Ontology Library (Commons) v1.2 (FND-389)." ;
