    fibo-be-ge-ge:hasFullSovereigntyOver lcc-3166-1:Belgium ;
    fibo-be-ge-ge:isRepresentedBy fibo-be-ge-weuj:GovernmentOfTheKingdomOfBelgium .

fibo-be-ge-weuj:FrenchEntity a owl:NamedIndividual,
